 "_doc": "What the troupe can do. library: the Quaternius Universal Animation Library clips (CC0), retargeted on demand (`_Loop` clips loop, the others hold their last frame). moves: hand-keyed actions on top of a library `base`: `keys` add bone rotations (local degrees; on the mixamo rig an arm's Z raises it, -Z for the right arm, and a forearm's X bends the elbow) at times in seconds, or at phases 0..1 of `cycle` seconds when the move loops; `prop` puts an object in the right hand (a barbell: in both, bar_strain / barbell_fall); `lie` lays the body on its back on the floor (head toward the spot's facing + 90 degrees); `face` is its default face. faces: ARKit face units (MPFB faceunits01) weights. seated: what every sitting clip adds (shoulders stay at rest, head a little down to the plate).",
